e on a multimodal canvas.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-09\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Persistent agent memory for design\", \"Multimodal canvas for brand consistency\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tirth8205/code-review-graph\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/tirth8205/code-review-graph\",\n    \"description\": \"Local-first code intelligence graph for MCP and CLI building persistent maps of codebases - codebase understanding and mapping tool.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-27\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Local-first code intelligence\", \"Builds persistent maps of codebases\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"AutoAgent-VersionCode\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/jaydenqiu51/AutoAgent-VersionCode\",\n    \"description\": \"AI Coding Agent Framework lets multiple AI agents work together on software projects with specialized roles: planning, coding, testing, debugging, reviewing, documentation.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-24\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Multi-agent framework with specialized roles\", \"Complete development workflow coverage\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"metalbear-co/mirrord\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/metalbear-co/mirrord\",\n    \"description\": \"Runs processes on local machines or AI agent environments as if in Kubernetes pods - bridges local development and cloud infrastructure for AI agents.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Bridges local and cloud environments\", \"Kubernetes integration for agents\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DarkPs-Agent-CLI\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/dark-ps/DarkPs-Agent-CLI\",\n    \"description\": \"Extensible local-first AI agent framework for automation, coding, tools, and multi-model workflows - flexible agent framework.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-22\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Local-first and extensible\", \"Multi-model workflow support\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"openclaude-improved\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/0xwilliamortiz/openclaude-improved\",\n    \"description\": \"Runs anywhere, uses anything. A versatile Claude-based agent with broad model support and cross-platform compatibility.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-26\",\n    \"category\": \"code agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Cross-platform Claude agent\", \"Broad model support\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"monoIDE\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/tripock/monoIDE\",\n    \"description\": \"A powerful IDE for notion AI agent that uses Notion2API for route to notion chat. An alternative AI IDE approach leveraging Notion as the interface.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-07-26\",\n    \"category\": \"Full AI IDE\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\"Notion-based AI IDE\", \"Alternative interface approach\"]\n  }\n]",
